      "title": {
        "en": "Energetic play and contented dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently observe how delighted their dogs are when arriving for daycare or overnight boarding. Clients report that energetic dogs return home happy and pleasantly tired after supervised play sessions in the indoor parks. Reviewers express deep reassurance knowing their pets receive individual companionship, playtime, and affectionate attention."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring hotel team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners praise the front-desk personnel and animal care staff for their cheerful greetings, prompt check-in procedures, and genuine love for animals. Reviewers mention that handlers take careful note of individual diets, medication schedules, and temperament preferences. Clients consistently report feeling valued and well-supported throughout each stay."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spotless suites and spacious playrooms"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the immaculate cleanliness of the boarding rooms, luxury dog suites, and climate-controlled indoor parks. Pet parents appreciate modern comforts such as elevated dog beds and televisions in private rooms, which help pets settle in smoothly. Families regularly describe the facility as a comfortable and odor-free home away from home."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What amenities are included in the boarding suites?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Suites include comfortable elevated bedding, flat-screen televisions, and climate-controlled private quarters."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are indoor play areas air-conditioned during hot weather?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, dogs exercise in spacious indoor dog parks designed to keep pets active and cool during Arizona heat."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can staff administer daily medication to boarding dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note that trained staff carefully administer prescribed medications and adhere to feeding schedules."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is daycare available for socialisation without boarding?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the facility provides supervised half-day and full-day daycare programmes grouped by size and play style."
      },
      "basis": "both"
